  "additional_notes": "Players have been asking for a Ratman-themed list ever since Warlords of Erehwon first came out. Ratters are generally held to be human shaped and sized - or a little smaller - furry, long-tailed and in all respects a humanoid rat. Scavengers par excellence, they live amongst the detritus of other races. Individually they are timid, hiding away in the shadows and avoiding danger where possible. Ratter Warlords are called Broodlords; Ratter Heroes are called Broodmasters.",
