  "special_rules": {
    "Pack": "Units with the Pack special rule are treated as having a Command stat equal to the Command stat of a Pack Master within 10\". If more than one Pack Master is within 10\", count the highest stat value. Applies to all rules that use the Command stat, including Automatic Breaks from Pins.",
    "Pack Master": "Extends and replaces the Command and Hero special rules. Ratter Warlords (Broodlords) and Heroes (Broodmasters) have Pack Master instead of Command/Hero. Ratter Warlocks also have Pack Master but count as Wizards, not Heroes. Added at 20pts to the individual with the rule.",
    "Venomous": "When a unit with Venomous hand-to-hand attacks scores one or more hits it automatically inflicts one extra hit in total. Similarly for Venomous ranged attacks.",
    "Choking": "Attacks ignore Res bonuses from armour and cover.",
    "Fire": "Fire attacks add an extra pin to targets they hit.",
    "Tough": "Re-roll a failed Res test (Tough 2 re-roll 2 separate fails, and so on).",
    "Frenzied Charge": "Gains additional attacks when charging.",
    "Irresistible Charge": "Charge cannot be resisted by certain rules.",
    "Rapid Sprint": "Can move an additional distance when sprinting.",
    "Spirit": "Ethereal unit; certain restrictions apply.",
    "Exchange of Missiles": "Can shoot during the exchange of missiles phase.",
    "Large": "+1 to hit shooting. Can draw LOS to body.",
    "Slow/Fast": "Move at the basic rate indicated.",
    "Command": "Friendly units within 10\" can use the model's Co stat to take Command based tests.",
    "Follow": "Friendly un-pinned units within 5\" can follow the unit's order immediately.",
    "Hero": "Friendly units within 10\" can use the model's Initiative stat to take Reaction tests.",
    "Wound": "Can lose the 'wounds value' of lives before a further Res fail slays.",
    "Berserk": "Unit fights with increased ferocity.",
    "Dread": "Enemies suffer penalties when targeting this unit."
  }
}